# Save route — a race on Trial Mountain, started from the user's finished save (game_files/UCES01245-GAMEDAT, checked against
# config/savedata.sha1, copied fresh per run by tools.decomp_gate; spec docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-23-savedata-routes-design.md).
# The empty-save route trialmtn.pad converted: with the save the main menu loads 0x2458a6c0 (not 0x1fa48900) with the cursor on
# Driving Challenges (three LEFTs to Single Player, 2000 after the load: 1200 lost the press under load), and the Single Player hub and Mode Selection
# remember the last choice (the hub's k-th visit goes left three times, then k-1 RIGHTs; Mode Selection left three
# times, then one RIGHT to Single Race's place). Reaches 61 functions the empty-save routes do not (with the other three save routes, 95, tools.route_reach).
3300:START,
WAIT:seek=0x2458a6c0,2000:LEFT,2100:LEFT,2200:LEFT,2400:CROSS,
WAIT:seek=0x1cf2a980,300:LEFT,400:LEFT,500:LEFT,700:CROSS,
